  "title": "Evotec Announces New Nomination to Board of Directors",
  "summary": "Evotec SE today announced the nomination of Dr. Wolfgang Hofmann for election as an independent member of the Supervisory Board at the company’s upcoming Annual General Meeting (AGM) to be held on June 11, 2026. The AGM agenda also includes the previously announced nomination of Dieter Weinand as Chairman of the Supervisory Board, as well as a proposal to increase the size of the Supervisory Board from six to seven members. Read full PR here.",
